 "bloques": [
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": {
    "@es": "Formación",
    "@en": "Training"
   },
   "texto": [
    {
     "@es": "Se forma con **nous** del presente, quitando **-ons** y añadiendo **-ant**: **nous parlons** → **parlant**, **nous finissons** → **finissant**.",
     "@en": "It is formed with **nous** from the present, removing **-ons** and adding **-ant**: **nous parlons** → **parlant**, **nous finissons** → **finissant**."
    },
    {
     "@es": "Irregulares: **être** → **étant**, **avoir** → **ayant**, **faire** → **faisant**.",
     "@en": "Unregular: **être** → **étant**, **avoir** → **ayant**, **faire** → **faisant**."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": {
    "@es": "Uso",
    "@en": "Use"
   },
   "texto": [
    {
     "@es": "Se usa con **en** delante: **en travaillant** (trabajando, mientras trabajo). Dice que dos acciones pasan a la vez o cómo se hace algo: **Je travaille en écoutant de la musique** (trabajo escuchando música).",
     "@en": "It is used with **en** in front of: **en travaillant** (working while working). He says two actions happen at once or how to do something: **Je travaille en écoutant de la musique** (I work listening to music)."
    }
   ]
  },
